      "writtenOn": "2024-09-30T17:13:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would you guess that there\u0027s a benefit for allowing them to choose a subset of the stats that they care about? Vs. just saying if they\u0027ve provided `fFinishedWithStats` we provide all supported stats?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 91,
