      "lineNbr": 91,
      "author": {
        "id": 13150
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-30T18:26:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It just seemed more conservative to me to only give what is asked for. Otherwise, if this expands we may have to generate a bunch of query objects when the client only cares about one. There are lots of possible things that can queried in different APIs/extensions:\n\nhttps://docs.vulkan.org/spec/latest/chapters/queries.html\n\nhttps://www.khronos.org/opengl/wiki/Query_Object",
      "parentUuid": "a23d3565_7b87bd18",
